{
  "title": { "zh": "同一部件，压低还是增强细节", "en": "Suppress or enhance detail" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "继续 <level-ref to=\"1-2\"></level-ref> 的两次轴向加权电路，先指定边缘延续，再增加带符号细节与增强支路。",
        "en": "Continue the two axis passes from <level-ref to=\"1-2\"></level-ref>, specify edge replication, then add signed-detail and enhancement branches."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "双轴处理器已经能汇合邻居。现在用课程给出的高斯权重处理细碎变化，再把被抑制的细节用于另一种任务。权重和与小数由系统计算，你决定图像之间的关系。 <wiki-ref to=\"smoothing-detail\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "The two-axis processor combines neighbours. Use supplied Gaussian weights to suppress fine variation, then reuse the removed detail for another purpose. Weight arithmetic is supplied; decide the image relationships. <wiki-ref to=\"smoothing-detail\"></wiki-ref>"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "\\[D=I-S,\\qquad E=I+\\alpha D\\]\n\nI 是原图，S 是平滑图，D 是被平滑压低的带符号细节，α 是增强强度。D 为正时增强会更亮，为负时会更暗；绝对差无法保留这种方向。增强也可能放大噪声，输出超出显示范围不等于计算错误。 <wiki-ref to=\"smoothing-detail\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "\\[D=I-S,\\qquad E=I+\\alpha D\\]\n\nI is the original, S the smoothed image, D the signed detail removed by smoothing and α the enhancement amount. Positive detail becomes brighter and negative detail darker; absolute difference loses that direction. Enhancement can amplify noise, and values outside the display range remain valid results. <wiki-ref to=\"smoothing-detail\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v1_smooth_border",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "先稳定边缘读数",
        "en": "Stabilise boundary readings"
      },
      "configurations": { "*.outside": ["clamp"] },
      "adds": [],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "使用给定的归一化权重做双轴平滑，图外延续最近边缘。恒定图的边缘必须仍是同一个读数；变化图仍应发生平滑。",
        "en": "Smooth along both axes with the supplied normalised weights, extending nearest edge values outside. Constant-image edges must stay constant; varying images must still be smoothed."
      },
      "after": {
        "zh": "\\[\\begin{gathered}S(p)=\\sum_\\delta h(\\delta)I(p+\\delta)\\\\\\sum_\\delta h(\\delta)=1\\end{gathered}\\]\n\nh 是给定的归一化高斯权重，S 是平滑结果。邻居共同参与会压低快速变化；归一化保持常量输入，但不能保证图中细节全部保留。图外读取仍由边界假设决定。 <wiki-ref to=\"smoothing-detail\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "\\[\\begin{gathered}S(p)=\\sum_\\delta h(\\delta)I(p+\\delta)\\\\\\sum_\\delta h(\\delta)=1\\end{gathered}\\]\n\nh is the supplied normalised Gaussian weighting and S the smoothed result. Combining neighbours suppresses rapid variation. Normalisation preserves constants, not all detail, and outside samples still depend on the border assumption. <wiki-ref to=\"smoothing-detail\"></wiki-ref>"
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "图", "en": "Image" } },
        { "name": "weights", "label": { "zh": "高斯权重", "en": "Weight vector" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "out", "label": { "zh": "平滑读数", "en": "Smoothed readings" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [
              [0.6, 0.6, 0.6],
              [0.6, 0.6, 0.6]
            ],
            "weights": [[0.25, 0.5, 0.25]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [[0.6, 0.6, 0.6], [0.6, 0.6, 0.6]]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[1, 0, 0], [0, 0, 0]],
            "weights": [[0.25, 0.5, 0.25]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [[0.5625, 0.1875, 0], [0.1875, 0.0625, 0]]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.2], [0.8], [0.4]],
            "weights": [[0.25, 0.5, 0.25]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "out": [[0.35000000000000003], [0.55], [0.5]]
          }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [],
      "solution": [
        "horizontal = const[kind=direction,x=1,y=0]()",
        "vertical = const[kind=direction,x=0,y=1]()",
        "h = weightedLine[outside=clamp](image,weights,horizontal)",
        "v = weightedLine[outside=clamp](h,weights,vertical)",
        "out <- v"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "horizontal = const[kind=direction,x=1,y=0]()",
        "vertical = const[kind=direction,x=0,y=1]()",
        "h = weightedLine[outside=zero](image,weights,horizontal)",
        "v = weightedLine[outside=zero](h,weights,vertical)",
        "out <- v"
      ],
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "补 0 会在恒定图边缘引入不存在的暗读数。延续边缘只改变图外取值，不能跳过图内平滑。",
        "en": "Zero extension invents dark samples at constant-image edges. Edge replication changes outside reads without skipping interior smoothing."
      },
      "intro": [
        {
          "fig": "outside-clamp",
          "t": {
            "zh": "双轴加权已经可用，但补 0 会让恒定图的边缘变暗。先单独更换边界假设：普通照片在边缘之外多半还是相近的景物，所以让图外维持最近边缘的读数。用恒定图和变化图区分边界效果与平滑效果。 <wiki-ref to=\"finite-boundaries\"></wiki-ref>",
            "en": "The two-axis filter works, but zero extension darkens constant-image edges. First change only the boundary assumption: in an ordinary photograph the scene just beyond the edge usually resembles the edge, so outside reads retain the nearest edge value. Contrast constant and varying images to separate boundary effects from smoothing. <wiki-ref to=\"finite-boundaries\"></wiki-ref>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "先比较角落与内部，再检查亮点是否仍会扩散；恒定图不变并不等于直接输出原图。",
          "en": "Compare corners with the interior, then check whether an impulse still spreads. Preserving a constant image is not the same as passing every image through unchanged."
        }
      ],
      "sample": {
        "inputs": {
          "image": {
            "size": [64, 64],
            "base": 0.25,
            "layers": [
              { "shape": "disc", "cx": 20, "cy": 22, "r": 13, "v": 0.8 },
              { "shape": "rect", "x": 38, "y": 8, "w": 18, "h": 34, "v": 0.55 },
              { "shape": "stripes", "period": 4, "lo": 0.2, "hi": 0.7, "x": 6, "y": 44, "w": 26, "h": 14 },
              { "shape": "checker", "cell": 2, "lo": 0.35, "hi": 0.6, "x": 40, "y": 46, "w": 16, "h": 12 }
            ],
            "noise": { "seed": 7, "amp": 0.06 }
          }
        }
      },
      "carry": "1-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_residual",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "取出被抹掉的细节",
        "en": "Separate the removed detail"
      },
      "adds": [],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "用给定的归一化权重做双轴平滑，图外延续最近边缘；另输出原图相对平滑图的带符号细节，使平滑图加上细节恰好回到原图。",
        "en": "Smooth along both axes with the supplied normalised weights, extending nearest edge values outside; also output the signed detail of the original relative to the smoothed image, so that smooth plus detail restores the original exactly."
      },
      "after": {
        "zh": "\\[D=I-S\\]\n\nI 是原图，S 是平滑图，D 是带符号残差。它记录平滑减去了什么；符号决定恢复或增强时该变亮还是变暗。|D| 只能描述改动大小。 <wiki-ref to=\"smoothing-detail\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "\\[D=I-S\\]\n\nI is the original, S the smoothed image and D the signed residual. It records what smoothing removed; the sign determines brightening versus darkening during restoration or enhancement. |D| retains only change size. <wiki-ref to=\"smoothing-detail\"></wiki-ref>"
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "图", "en": "Image" } },
        { "name": "weights", "label": { "zh": "高斯权重", "en": "Weight vector" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "smooth", "label": { "zh": "平滑图", "en": "Smoothed" } },
        { "name": "detail", "label": { "zh": "细节", "en": "Detail" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [
              [0.2, 0.2, 0.2],
              [0.8, 0.8, 0.8],
              [0.2, 0.2, 0.2]
            ],
            "weights": [[0.25, 0.5, 0.25]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "smooth": [
              [
                0.35,
                0.35,
                0.35
              ],
              [
                0.5,
                0.5,
                0.5
              ],
              [
                0.35,
                0.35,
                0.35
              ]
            ],
            "detail": [[-0.15, -0.15, -0.15], [0.3, 0.3, 0.3], [-0.15, -0.15, -0.15]]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.7, 0.7, 0.7], [0.7, 0.1, 0.7], [0.7, 0.7, 0.7]],
            "weights": [[0.25, 0.5, 0.25]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "smooth": [
              [0.6625, 0.625, 0.6625],
              [0.625, 0.55, 0.625],
              [0.6625, 0.625, 0.6625]
            ],
            "detail": [[0.0375, 0.075, 0.0375], [0.075, -0.45, 0.075], [0.0375, 0.075, 0.0375]]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4], [0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4]],
            "weights": [[0.25, 0.5, 0.25]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "smooth": [[0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4], [0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4]],
            "detail": [[0, 0, 0, 0], [0, 0, 0, 0]]
          }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [],
      "solution": [
        "horizontal = const[kind=direction,x=1,y=0]()",
        "vertical = const[kind=direction,x=0,y=1]()",
        "h = weightedLine[outside=clamp](image,weights,horizontal)",
        "v = weightedLine[outside=clamp](h,weights,vertical)",
        "r = arithmetic[op=sub](image,v)",
        "smooth <- v",
        "detail <- r"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "horizontal = const[kind=direction,x=1,y=0]()",
        "vertical = const[kind=direction,x=0,y=1]()",
        "h = weightedLine[outside=clamp](image,weights,horizontal)",
        "v = weightedLine[outside=clamp](h,weights,vertical)",
        "r = difference(image,v)",
        "smooth <- v",
        "detail <- r"
      ],
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "绝对差只记下改动有多大，丢掉了方向：暗点中心的细节变成正数，平滑图加上它也回不到原图。",
        "en": "Absolute difference keeps only how much changed and drops the direction: the dark dot’s centre turns positive, and smooth plus it no longer restores the original."
      },
      "intro": [
        {
          "t": {
            "zh": "边缘读数已经稳定。平滑图比原图少了一部分变化：先把这部分单独取出，保留成一张图。比较亮线和暗点，确认它记下的不只是改动有多大。 <wiki-ref to=\"smoothing-detail\"></wiki-ref>",
            "en": "Boundary readings are now stable. The smoothed image lacks part of the original’s variation: separate that part and keep it as an image. Compare a bright line with a dark dot to confirm it records more than how much changed. <wiki-ref to=\"smoothing-detail\"></wiki-ref>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "看暗点图的中心：原图在那里比平滑图暗还是亮？细节在那里应当是什么符号？",
          "en": "Look at the centre of the dark dot: is the original darker or brighter there than the smoothed image? What sign should the detail have there?"
        }
      ],
      "sample": {
        "inputs": {
          "image": {
            "size": [64, 64],
            "base": 0.25,
            "layers": [
              { "shape": "disc", "cx": 20, "cy": 22, "r": 13, "v": 0.8 },
              { "shape": "rect", "x": 38, "y": 8, "w": 18, "h": 34, "v": 0.55 },
              { "shape": "stripes", "period": 4, "lo": 0.2, "hi": 0.7, "x": 6, "y": 44, "w": 26, "h": 14 },
              { "shape": "checker", "cell": 2, "lo": 0.35, "hi": 0.6, "x": 40, "y": 46, "w": 16, "h": 12 }
            ],
            "noise": { "seed": 7, "amp": 0.06 }
          }
        }
      },
      "carries": true
    },
    {
      "id": "v1_detail",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "平滑与细节",
        "en": "Smoothing and detail"
      },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "用已归一化的高斯样本权重平滑，再按给定强度增强原图相对平滑图的带符号细节。另输出平滑改动的大小。",
        "en": "Smooth with supplied normalised Gaussian sample weights, enhance signed detail at the given strength, and report the magnitude of the smoothing change."
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "图", "en": "Image" } },
        { "name": "amount", "label": { "zh": "细节强度", "en": "Detail strength" } },
        { "name": "weights", "label": { "zh": "高斯权重", "en": "Weight vector" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "smooth", "label": { "zh": "平滑图", "en": "Smoothed" } },
        { "name": "enhanced", "label": { "zh": "细节增强图", "en": "Enhanced" } },
        { "name": "change", "label": { "zh": "改动大小", "en": "Change magnitude" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [
              [0.2, 0.6000000000000001, 0.2, 0.6000000000000001, 0.2],
              [0.2, 0.6000000000000001, 0.2, 0.6000000000000001, 0.2],
              [0.2, 0.6000000000000001, 0.2, 0.6000000000000001, 0.2]
            ],
            "amount": 1,
            "weights": [[0.274068619061197, 0.45186276187760605, 0.274068619061197]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "smooth": [
              [
                0.3096274476244788,
                0.3807451047510425,
                0.41925489524895765,
                0.3807451047510425,
                0.30962744762447886
              ],
              [
                0.3096274476244788,
                0.3807451047510425,
                0.41925489524895765,
                0.3807451047510425,
                0.30962744762447886
              ],
              [
                0.3096274476244788,
                0.3807451047510425,
                0.41925489524895765,
                0.3807451047510425,
                0.30962744762447886
              ]
            ],
            "enhanced": [
              [
                0.09037255237552122,
                0.8192548952489577,
                -0.019254895248957626,
                0.8192548952489577,
                0.09037255237552116
              ],
              [
                0.09037255237552122,
                0.8192548952489577,
                -0.019254895248957626,
                0.8192548952489577,
                0.09037255237552116
              ],
              [
                0.09037255237552122,
                0.8192548952489577,
                -0.019254895248957626,
                0.8192548952489577,
                0.09037255237552116
              ]
            ],
            "change": [
              [
                0.10962744762447879,
                0.21925489524895758,
                0.21925489524895764,
                0.21925489524895758,
                0.10962744762447885
              ],
              [
                0.10962744762447879,
                0.21925489524895758,
                0.21925489524895764,
                0.21925489524895758,
                0.10962744762447885
              ],
              [
                0.10962744762447879,
                0.21925489524895758,
                0.21925489524895764,
                0.21925489524895758,
                0.10962744762447885
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.1, 0.1, 0.8, 0.8], [0.1, 0.9, 0.8, 0.8], [0.1, 0.1, 0.8, 0.8]],
            "amount": 0.6,
            "weights": [[0.274068619061197, 0.45186276187760605, 0.274068619061197]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "smooth": [
              [0.16009088636328922, 0.39092115586521714, 0.6682428530204514, 0.8],
              [0.19907312252237921, 0.4551919978001644, 0.7072250891795414, 0.8],
